    {
      "id": "text-39",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 653,
      "width": 1210,
      "height": 38,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2077,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2078,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关键差异：etcd 和 MongoDB 都在投票环节校验「日志/数据新鲜度」（isUpToDate / lastWrittenOpTime），\nRedis Sentinel 只看谁先拿到多数票，不检查候选者的数据版本 —— 这是它可能选出落后节点的根源。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 38,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关键差异：etcd 和 MongoDB 都在投票环节校验「日志/数据新鲜度」（isUpToDate / lastWrittenOpTime），\nRedis Sentinel 只看谁先拿到多数票，不检查候选者的数据版本 —— 这是它可能选出落后节点的根源。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
